      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOT TO RULE (1) jumps from box 1 for the first time after scoring at this track (23.04) in a Grade 5. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. SWIFT EDDY (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (23.63) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Expected to bounce back to best. HUXLEY'S ROCKET (8) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 3.5 lengths away in fourth (23.53). Was in the money the start prior. Expected to feature in the finish. RAMJET (7) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
